      "writtenOn": "2026-10-16T18:18:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unit question: this multiplies port_speed by 1000 (treating the stored value as Gbps), whereas the juniper driver emits `speed {port_speed}g` and README/CLI examples use `--interface-speed 1000` (reads as Mbps) while docs/quads-api.md examples use \"speed\": 10 (reads as Gbps). On EOS, `speed` takes Mbps — for a port stored as 1000, this yields `speed 1000000` (1 Tbps), which EOS rejects. Please pin down and document the unit (and validate at CLI/API boundary) so the README, API docs, and both drivers agree.",
      "revId": "5ec35ddcb58a94477c496dce5f20d1f94223a05f",
